        "original": "杉並",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Suginami",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        },
        "reading": "すぎなみ"
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "original": "「そうだ。今日からだったのは知っておろう」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Benar. Kamu harusnya tahu kalau itu dimulai hari ini」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        },
        "reading": "「そうだ。きょうからだたのはしるておる」"
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        },
        "reading": "かずと"
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "original": "「知ってたけど、行ってないぞ。そもそもチケットの入手すら出来なかった」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Aku tahu, tapi aku nggak pergi. Lagian, dapat tiketnya saja nggak bisa」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        },
        "reading": "「しるてるたけれど、いくてるないぞ。そもそもちけっとのにゅうしゅすらできるないた」"
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "original": "杉並",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Suginami",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        },
        "reading": "すぎなみ"
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "original": "「ふむ、そうか……」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Hmm, begitu ya...」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        },
        "reading": "「ふむ、そうか……」"
    },
    {
